    <node id="788f10f8-baad-4b11-94e7-e9db4a39b59a">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Universal Life Policy Overview","text":"═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n              UNIVERSAL LIFE INSURANCE POLICY\n              FlexProtect Insurance Solutions\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nContract Number: FPS-UL-24-03391\nIssue Date: March 10, 2024\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPOLICY OWNER &amp; INSURED\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nOwner: Robert James Wilson\nInsured: Robert James Wilson\nGender: Male | DOB: 11/15/1982 | Age: 41\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nCOVERAGE SPECIFICATIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSpecified Amount (Face Value): $400,000\nPlanned Premium: $200/month\nMinimum Premium: $75/month\nTarget Premium: $200/month\nDeath Benefit Option: Level (Option A)\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nBENEFICIARY INFORMATION\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPrimary: Jennifer Ann Wilson (Wife) - 100%\nContingent: Robert Wilson Jr. (Son) - 50%\n            Emily Rose Wilson (Daughter) - 50%\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════","summary":"This universal life insurance policy, issued by FlexProtect Insurance Solutions, covers Robert James Wilson with a $400,000 death benefit under a level (Option A) payout structure. The owner and insured are both Robert Wilson, who pays a planned premium of $200 per month, with a minimum required payment of $75. Primary beneficiary is his wife, Jennifer Ann Wilson, while their children—Robert Wilson Jr. and Emily Rose Wilson—are designated as contingent beneficiaries, each receiving 50% if needed.","topics":["Life Insurance","Policy Details","Beneficiary Designation","Premium Structure"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Contract Identifier","sentence":"The contract number for the Universal Life Insurance Policy is FPS-UL-24-03391.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Contract Number","Universal Life Insurance","Policy Reference"],"entities":[{"name":"Robert James Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"Policy Owner and Insured","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Jennifer Ann Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"Primary Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["100%"]},{"name":"Robert Wilson Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["50%","son"]},{"name":"Emily Rose Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["50%","daughter"]},{"name":"FlexProtect Insurance Solutions","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"Insurance Provider","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"FPS-UL-24-03391","type":"CONTRACT","role":"Universal Life Insurance Policy Contract","relational_anchors":["Contract Number"]},{"name":"March 10, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"Policy Issue Date","relational_anchors":["Issue Date"]},{"name":"$400,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"Specified Death Benefit Face Value","relational_anchors":["Specified Amount","Face Value"]},{"name":"$200/month","type":"AMOUNT","role":"Planned and Target Premium Payment","relational_anchors":["Planned Premium","Target Premium"]},{"name":"$75/month","type":"AMOUNT","role":"Minimum Required Premium","relational_anchors":["Minimum Premium"]},{"name":"Level (Option A)","type":"OPTION","role":"Death Benefit Payout Structure","relational_anchors":["Death Benefit Option"]}]},{"name":"Policy Issue Date","sentence":"The issue date of the Universal Life Insurance Policy is March 10, 2024.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Issue Date","Universal Life Insurance"],"entities":[{"name":"Robert James Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"Policy Owner and Insured","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Jennifer Ann Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"Primary Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["100%"]},{"name":"Robert Wilson Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"Contingent Beneficiary","relational_anchors":["50%","so