    <node id="496d325d-0eac-48eb-ab22-c254d8ec6bbf">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Insurance Policy Terms &amp; Benefits","text":"Contingent: Robert Wilson Jr. (Son) - 50%\n            Emily Rose Wilson (Daughter) - 50%\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 1 - DEFINITIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n1.1 \"Account Value\" means the accumulation of premiums paid, less \n    deductions for monthly charges and expenses, plus interest \n    credited.\n\n1.2 \"Cost of Insurance\" (COI) means the monthly charge for the \n    death benefit based on the insured's age, sex, and risk class.\n\n1.3 \"Monthly Deduction Date\" is the 10th day of each month.\n\n1.4 \"Surrender Charge\" is a percentage-based charge applied if the \n    policy is surrendered in the first 15 years.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 2 - FLEXIBLE PREMIUM PAYMENTS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n2.1 You may pay premiums at any time and in any amount, subject \n    to the following limits:\n\n    Minimum: $75 per payment\n    Maximum: $50,000 per year (subject to tax limitations)\n\n2.2 Premiums are allocated to the Account Value after deduction \n    of a 3% premium expense charge.\n\n2.3 You may skip payments as long as the Account Value is \n    sufficient to cover monthly deductions.\n\n2.4 If Account Value falls below the amount needed to pay monthly \n    charges, the policy will enter a 61-day grace period.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 3 - MONTHLY DEDUCTIONS\n══════════════════════════════════════════","summary":"This document defines essential terms and operational rules for a life insurance policy, including how Account Value accumulates through premiums minus fees and charges. Flexible premium payments are allowed within annual and per-payment limits, with a 3% expense charge deducted upon deposit. Monthly deductions apply unless waived during a 61-day grace period when the account balance drops too low. Beneficiaries are designated as Robert Wilson Jr. and Emily Rose Wilson, each entitled to half the proceeds.","topics":["Life Insurance Policy","Premium Payments","Policy Terms","Beneficiary Designation"],"facts":[{"name":"Father-Son Relationship","sentence":"Robert Wilson Jr. is the son of Robert Wilson Sr.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Family Structure","Contingent Beneficiary","Ownership Designation"],"entities":[{"name":"Robert Wilson Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (son)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Emily Rose Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (daughter)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"accumulated fund balance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monthly death benefit cost","relational_anchors":["based on age, sex, and risk class"]},{"name":"10th day of each month","type":"DATE","role":"fixed monthly deduction date","relational_anchors":["Monthly Deduction Date"]},{"name":"Surrender Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"early termination fee","relational_anchors":["first 15 years"]},{"name":"Minimum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"lowest allowable payment threshold","relational_anchors":["$75 per payment"]},{"name":"Maximum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual cap on premium contributions","relational_anchors":["$50,000 per year"]},{"name":"Premium Expense Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"deducted before allocation","relational_anchors":["3%"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"extension for missed payments","relational_anchors":["61-day"]}]},{"name":"Incorrect Family Relationship","sentence":"Emily Rose Wilson is the daughter of Robert Wilson Sr.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Family Relationships","Policy Beneficiaries","Robert Wilson Jr."],"entities":[{"name":"Robert Wilson Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (son)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Emily Rose Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (daughter)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"accumulated fund balance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monthly death benefit cost","relational_anchors":["based on age, sex, and risk class"]},{"name":"10th day of each month","type":"DATE","role":"fixed monthly deduction date","relational_anchors":["Monthly Deduction Date"]},{"name":"Surrender Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"early termination fee","relational_anchors":["first 15 years"]},{"name":"Minimum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"lowest allowable payment threshold","relational_anchors":["$75 per payment"]},{"name":"Maximum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual cap on premium contributions","relational_anchors":["$50,000 per year"]},{"name":"Premium Expense Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"deducted before allocation","relational_anchors":["3%"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"extension for missed payments","relational_anchors":["61-day"]}]},{"name":"Contingent Beneficiary Interest","sentence":"Robert Wilson Jr. holds a 50% contingent interest in the policy.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["contingent beneficiary","beneficiary distribution","policy ownership"],"entities":[{"name":"Robert Wilson Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (son)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Emily Rose Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (daughter)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"accumulated fund balance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monthly death benefit cost","relational_anchors":["based on age, sex, and risk class"]},{"name":"10th day of each month","type":"DATE","role":"fixed monthly deduction date","relational_anchors":["Monthly Deduction Date"]},{"name":"Surrender Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"early termination fee","relational_anchors":["first 15 years"]},{"name":"Minimum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"lowest allowable payment threshold","relational_anchors":["$75 per payment"]},{"name":"Maximum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual cap on premium contributions","relational_anchors":["$50,000 per year"]},{"name":"Premium Expense Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"deducted before allocation","relational_anchors":["3%"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"extension for missed payments","relational_anchors":["61-day"]}]},{"name":"50% Contingent Interest","sentence":"Emily Rose Wilson holds a 50% contingent interest in the policy.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["contingent interest","policy ownership","beneficiary share"],"entities":[{"name":"Robert Wilson Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (son)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Emily Rose Wilson","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary (daughter)","relational_anchors":["50%"]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"accumulated fund balance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monthly death benefit cost","relational_anchors":["based on age, sex, and risk class"]},{"name":"10th day of each month","type":"DATE","role":"fixed monthly deduction date","relational_anchors":["Monthly Deduction Date"]},{"name":"Surrender Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"early termination fee","relational_anchors":["first 15 years"]},{"name":"Minimum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"lowest allowable payment threshold","relational_anchors":["$75 per payment"]},{"name":"Maximum","type":"CONCEPT","role":"annual cap on premium contributions","relational_anchors":["$50,000 per year"]},{"name":"Premium Expense Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"deducted before allocation","relational_anchors":["3%"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"extension for missed payments","relational_anchors":["61-day"]}]},{"name":"Account Value Definition","sentence":"