    <node id="8d7899f3-c38f-4f88-95bb-fe250f7c5f9c">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Policy Financial Terms Overview","text":"═══════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 3 - MONTHLY DEDUCTIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n3.1 On each Monthly Deduction Date, we deduct from Account Value:\n    (a) Cost of Insurance charge\n    (b) Administrative expense charge: $8.00/month\n    (c) Any outstanding policy loan interest\n\n3.2 Cost of Insurance is calculated as:\n    (Specified Amount - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate / 1,000\n\n3.3 COI rates are guaranteed not to exceed those shown in the \n    rate schedule attached to this policy.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 4 - INTEREST CREDITING\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n4.1 Interest is credited to Account Value daily based on the \n    current credited interest rate.\n\n4.2 Guaranteed minimum rate: 2.0% per annum\n    Current rate: 3.5% per annum (subject to change monthly)\n\n4.3 We may declare different rates for different policy years or \n    account value amounts.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 5 - DEATH BENEFIT\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n5.1 OPTION A (Level Death Benefit) - Currently Selected\n    Death Benefit = Specified Amount\n\n5.2 OPTION B (Increasing Death Benefit) - Available by Request\n    Death Benefit = Specified Amount + Account Value\n\n5.3 You may change death benefit options subject to:\n    (a) Evidence of insurability if increasing coverage\n    (b) Payment of a $50 processing fee\n\n5.4 Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy","summary":"This section defines the monthly fees deducted from the policy's account value, including cost of insurance, administrative expenses, and loan interest. Interest is credited daily at a current rate of 3.5% annually (with a guaranteed minimum of 2%), potentially varying by policy year or account size. Two death benefit options exist—level (fixed amount) and increasing (amount plus account value)—with changes requiring evidence of insurability and a $50 fee when upgrading; payouts reduce outstanding loans.","topics":["Monthly Deductions","Interest Crediting","Death Benefit Options"],"facts":[{"name":"Monthly Deductions Schedule","sentence":"A deduction occurs on each Monthly Deduction Date.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Monthly Deduction Date","Account Value Deductions","Policy Charges"],"entities":[{"name":"Monthly Deduction Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger date for deductions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"insurance cost deduction","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Administrative expense charge: $8.00/month","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed administrative fee","relational_anchors":["$8.00"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loan interest","type":"CHARGE","role":"interest on unpaid loans","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance is calculated as: (Specified Amount - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate / 1,000","type":"FORMULA","role":"calculation method for COI","relational_anchors":["COI Rate"]},{"name":"guaranteed not to exceed those shown in the rate schedule","type":"RATE","role":"rate cap condition","relational_anchors":["rate schedule"]},{"name":"Guaranteed minimum rate: 2.0% per annum","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"minimum annual interest floor","relational_anchors":["2.0%"]},{"name":"Current rate: 3.5% per annum (subject to change monthly)","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"current credit rate","relational_anchors":["3.5%","monthly"]},{"name":"Option A (Level Death Benefit) - Currently Selected","type":"OPTION","role":"selected death benefit option","relational_anchors":["Currently Selected"]},{"name":"Option B (Increasing Death Benefit) - Available by Request","type":"OPTION","role":"requestable alternative benefit","relational_anchors":["Available by Request"]},{"name":"Evidence of insurability if increasing coverage","type":"CONDITION","role":"requirement for plan upgrade","relational_anchors":["increasing coverage"]},{"name":"Payment of a $50 processing fee","type":"CHARGE","role":"fee for changing benefit option","relational_anchors":["$50"]},{"name":"Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy","type":"BENEFIT","role":"net payout after debts","relational_anchors":["outstanding policy"]}]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance Deduction Timing","sentence":"On each Monthly Deduction Date, the Cost of Insurance charge is deducted from Account Value.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Monthly Deduction Date","Cost of Insurance Charge","Account Value Deductions"],"entities":[{"name":"Monthly Deduction Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger date for deductions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"insurance cost deduction","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Administrative expense charge: $8.00/month","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed administrative fee","relational_anchors":["$8.00"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loan interest","type":"CHARGE","role":"interest on unpaid loans","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance is calculated as: (Specified Amount - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate / 1,000","type":"FORMULA","role":"calculation method for COI","relational_anchors":["COI Rate"]},{"name":"guaranteed not to exceed those shown in the rate schedule","type":"RATE","role":"rate cap condition","relational_anchors":["rate schedule"]},{"name":"Guaranteed minimum rate: 2.0% per annum","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"minimum annual interest floor","relational_anchors":["2.0%"]},{"name":"Current rate: 3.5% per annum (subject to change monthly)","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"current credit rate","relational_anchors":["3.5%","monthly"]},{"name":"Option A (Level Death Benefit) - Currently Selected","type":"OPTION","role":"selected death benefit option","relational_anchors":["Currently Selected"]},{"name":"Option B (Increasing Death Benefit) - Available by Request","type":"OPTION","role":"requestable alternative benefit","relational_anchors":["Available by Request"]},{"name":"Evidence of insurability if increasing coverage","type":"CONDITION","role":"requirement for plan upgrade","relational_anchors":["increasing coverage"]},{"name":"Payment of a $50 processing fee","type":"CHARGE","role":"fee for changing benefit option","relational_anchors":["$50"]},{"name":"Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy","type":"BENEFIT","role":"net payout after debts","relational_anchors":["outstanding policy"]}]},{"name":"Monthly Admin Charge Deduction","sentence":"On each Monthly Deduction Date, the Administrative expense charge of $8.00 per month is deducted from Account Value.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Administrative Expense Charge","Monthly Deduction Date","Account Value Reduction"],"entities":[{"name":"Monthly Deduction Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger date for deductions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"insurance cost deduction","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Administrative expense charge: $8.00/month","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed administrative fee","relational_anchors":["$8.00"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loan interest","type":"CHARGE","role":"interest on unpaid loans","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance is calculated as: (Specified Amount - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate / 1,000","type":"FORMULA","role":"calculation method for COI","relational_anchors":["COI Rate"]},{"name":"guaranteed not to exceed those shown in the rate schedule","type":"RATE","role":"rate cap condition","relational_anchors":["rate schedule"]},{"name":"Guaranteed minimum rate: 2.0% per annum","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"minimum annual interest floor","relational_anchors":["2.0%"]},{"name":"Current rate: 3.5% per annum (subject to change monthly)","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"current credit rate","relational_anchors":["3.5%","monthly"]},{"name":"Option A (Level Death Benefit) - Currently Selected","type":"OPTION","role":"selected death benefit option","relational_anchors":["Currently Selected"]},{"name":"Option B (Increasing Death Benefit) - Available by Request","type":"OPTION","role":"requestable alternative benefit","relational_anchors":["Available by Request"]},{"name":"Evidence of insurability if increasing coverage","type":"CONDITION","role":"requirement for plan upgrade","relational_anchors":["increasing coverage"]},{"name":"Payment of a $50 processing fee","type":"CHARGE","role":"fee for changing benefit option","relational_anchors":["$50"]},{"name":"Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy","type":"BENEFIT","role":"net payout after debts","relational_anchors":["outstanding policy"]}]},{"name":"Loan Interest Deduction","sentence":"On each Monthly Deduction Date, any outstanding policy loan interest is deducted from Account Value.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Monthly Deduction Date","Policy Loan Interest","Account Value Deductions"],"entities":[{"name":"Monthly Deduction Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger date for deductions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"insurance cost deduction","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Administrative expense charge: $8.00/month","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed administrative fee","relational_anchors":["$8.00"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loan interest","type":"CHARGE","role":"interest on unpaid loans","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance is calculated as: (Specified Amount - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate / 1,000","type":"FORMULA","role":"calculation method for COI","relational_anchors":["COI Rate"]},{"name":"guaranteed not to exceed those shown in the rate schedule","type":"RATE","role":"rate cap condition","relational_anchors":["rate schedule"]},{"name":"Guaranteed minimum rate: 2.0% per annum","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"minimum annual interest floor","relational_anchors":["2.0%"]},{"name":"Current rate: 3.5% per annum (subject to change monthly)","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"current credit rate","relational_anchors":["3.5%","monthly"]},{"name":"Option A (Level Death Benefit) - Currently Selected","type":"OPTION","role":"selected death benefit option","relational_anchors":["Currently Selected"]},{"name":"Option B (Increasing Death Benefit) - Available by Request","type":"OPTION","role":"requestable alternative benefit","relational_anchors":["Available by Request"]},{"name":"Evidence of insurability if increasing coverage","type":"CONDITION","role":"requirement for plan upgrade","relational_anchors":["increasing coverage"]},{"name":"Payment of a $50 processing fee","type":"CHARGE","role":"fee for changing benefit option","relational_anchors":["$50"]},{"name":"Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy","type":"BENEFIT","role":"net payout after debts","relational_anchors":["outstanding policy"]}]},{"name":"COI Calculation Formula","sentence":"Cost of Insurance is calculated as (Specified Amount - Account Value) multiplied by Monthly COI Rate divided by 1,000.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Cost of Insurance","Monthly Deductions","Account Value"],"entities":[{"name":"Monthly Deduction Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger date for deductions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"insurance cost deduction","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Administrative expense charge: $8.00/month","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed administrative fee","relational_anchors":["$8.00"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loan interest","type":"CHARGE","role":"interest on unpaid loans","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance is calculated as: (Specified Amount - Account Value) × Monthly COI Rate / 1,000","type":"FORMULA","role":"calculation method for COI","relational_anchors":["COI Rate"]},{"name":"guaranteed not to exceed those shown in the rate schedule","type":"RATE","role":"rate cap condition","relational_anchors":["rate schedule"]},{"name":"Guaranteed minimum rate: 2.0% per annum","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"minimum annual interest floor","relational_anchors":["2.0%"]},{"name":"Current rate: 3.5% per annum (subject to change monthly)","type":"INTEREST_RATE","role":"current credit rate","relational_anchors":["3.5%","monthly"]},{"name":"Option A (Level Death Benefit) - Currently Selected","type":"OPTION","role":"selected death benefit option","relational_anchors":["Currently Selected"]},{"name":"Option B (Increasing Death Benefit) - Available by Request","type":"OPTION","role":"requestable alternative benefit","relational_anchors":["Available by Request"]},{"name":"Evidence of insurability if increasing coverage","type":"CONDITION","role":"requirement for plan upgrade","relational_anchors":["increasing coverage"]},{"name":"Payment of a $50 processing fee","type":"CHARGE","role":"fee for changing benefit option","relational_anchors":["$50"]},{"name":"Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy","type":"BENEFIT","role":"net payout after debts","relational_anchors":["outstanding policy"]}]},{"name":"Guaranteed COI Rate Cap","sentence":"COI rates are guaranteed not to exceed the rates specified in the rate schedule attached to this policy.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Cost of Insurance","Rate Schedule Guarantee","Policy Charges"],"entities":[{"name":"Monthly Deduction Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"trigger date for deductions","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance charge","type":"CHARGE","role":"insurance cost deduction","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Administrative expense charge: $8.00/month","type":"CHARGE","role":"fixed administrative fee","relational_anchors":["$8.00"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loan interest","type":"CHARGE","role":"interest on unpaid loans","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Cost of Insurance is calculated as: (Specified Amount - Account Value) × Monthly COI