    <node id="93d5653d-6032-4baf-b6fb-ab72b0242eaa">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Policy Financial Features Overview","text":"\n\n5.3 You may change death benefit options subject to:\n    (a) Evidence of insurability if increasing coverage\n    (b) Payment of a $50 processing fee\n\n5.4 Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy loans.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 6 - PARTIAL WITHDRAWALS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n6.1 You may make partial withdrawals from Account Value at any time.\n\n6.2 Minimum withdrawal: $500\n    Maximum: Account Value minus amount needed to keep policy in force\n\n6.3 Withdrawal charges:\n    Years 1-10: $25 per withdrawal\n    Years 11+: No charge\n\n6.4 Withdrawals reduce Account Value and may reduce death benefit \n    if Account Value falls below minimum required.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 7 - POLICY LOANS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n7.1 Maximum loan: 90% of current Account Value\n\n7.2 Loan interest rate: Variable rate = Moody's Corporate Bond \n    Index + 1.5%, minimum 4%, adjusted annually each January 1\n\n7.3 Interest may be paid annually or added to loan balance\n\n7.4 Outstanding loan reduces death benefit dollar-for-dollar\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 8 - SURRENDER\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n8.1 Cash Surrender Value = Account Value - Surrender Charge - \n    Outstanding Loans\n\n8.2 Surrender Charge Schedule (% of Specified Amount):\n    Year 1: 8","summary":"This section details critical aspects of a life insurance policy’s operational mechanics. Changes to death benefits require evidence of insurability when increasing coverage and incur a $50 fee. Partial withdrawals are allowed anytime but are limited by minimums ($500), maximums based on maintaining policy validity, and carry annual fees during the first decade. Policy loans can reach up to 90% of account value, accrue variable interest tied to a bond index, and directly reduce the death benefit. Upon surrender, cash value equals account value minus outstanding loans and surrender charges, which start at 8% in year one.","topics":["Death Benefit Options","Partial Withdrawals","Policy Loans","Surrender Terms"],"facts":[{"name":"Change Death Benefit Options","sentence":"You may change death benefit options.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Death Benefit Changes","Policy Flexibility","Insurability Requirement"],"entities":[{"name":"death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"benefit payable upon death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"processing fee for changing option","relational_anchors":["Article 5.3"]},{"name":"$500","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"minimum partial withdrawal amount","relational_anchors":["Article 6.2"]},{"name":"$25","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"withdrawal charge during first decade","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum allowable loan percentage","relational_anchors":["Article 7.1"]},{"name":"Moody's Corporate Bond Index + 1.5%","type":"RATE","role":"variable loan interest calculation basis","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"4%","type":"MINIMUM_RATE","role":"floor rate for variable loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"January 1","type":"DATE","role":"annual adjustment date for loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"Years 1-10","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period when withdrawal charge applies","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"Years 11+","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period with no withdrawal charge","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"8","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"surrender charge in year one","relational_anchors":["Article 8.2"]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"fund balance available for withdrawals or loans","relational_anchors":["Article 6.1","Article 7.1","Article 8.1"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"debt reducing death benefit directly","relational_anchors":["Article 5.4","Article 7.4","Article 8.1"]},{"name":"cash surrender value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"net payout upon policy termination","relational_anchors":["Article 8.1"]}]},{"name":"Evidence of Insurability for Coverage Increase","sentence":"Changing death benefit options requires evidence of insurability if increasing coverage.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["death benefit modification","evidence of insurability","coverage increase"],"entities":[{"name":"death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"benefit payable upon death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"processing fee for changing option","relational_anchors":["Article 5.3"]},{"name":"$500","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"minimum partial withdrawal amount","relational_anchors":["Article 6.2"]},{"name":"$25","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"withdrawal charge during first decade","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum allowable loan percentage","relational_anchors":["Article 7.1"]},{"name":"Moody's Corporate Bond Index + 1.5%","type":"RATE","role":"variable loan interest calculation basis","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"4%","type":"MINIMUM_RATE","role":"floor rate for variable loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"January 1","type":"DATE","role":"annual adjustment date for loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"Years 1-10","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period when withdrawal charge applies","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"Years 11+","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period with no withdrawal charge","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"8","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"surrender charge in year one","relational_anchors":["Article 8.2"]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"fund balance available for withdrawals or loans","relational_anchors":["Article 6.1","Article 7.1","Article 8.1"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"debt reducing death benefit directly","relational_anchors":["Article 5.4","Article 7.4","Article 8.1"]},{"name":"cash surrender value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"net payout upon policy termination","relational_anchors":["Article 8.1"]}]},{"name":"Processing Fee for Benefit Change","sentence":"A $50 processing fee must be paid when changing death benefit options.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["death benefit changes","processing fee","policy modifications"],"entities":[{"name":"death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"benefit payable upon death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"processing fee for changing option","relational_anchors":["Article 5.3"]},{"name":"$500","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"minimum partial withdrawal amount","relational_anchors":["Article 6.2"]},{"name":"$25","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"withdrawal charge during first decade","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum allowable loan percentage","relational_anchors":["Article 7.1"]},{"name":"Moody's Corporate Bond Index + 1.5%","type":"RATE","role":"variable loan interest calculation basis","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"4%","type":"MINIMUM_RATE","role":"floor rate for variable loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"January 1","type":"DATE","role":"annual adjustment date for loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"Years 1-10","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period when withdrawal charge applies","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"Years 11+","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period with no withdrawal charge","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"8","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"surrender charge in year one","relational_anchors":["Article 8.2"]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"fund balance available for withdrawals or loans","relational_anchors":["Article 6.1","Article 7.1","Article 8.1"]},{"name":"outstanding policy loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"debt reducing death benefit directly","relational_anchors":["Article 5.4","Article 7.4","Article 8.1"]},{"name":"cash surrender value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"net payout upon policy termination","relational_anchors":["Article 8.1"]}]},{"name":"Death Benefit Reduction","sentence":"Death benefit is paid minus any outstanding policy loans.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["death benefit","policy loans","account value"],"entities":[{"name":"death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"benefit payable upon death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"processing fee for changing option","relational_anchors":["Article 5.3"]},{"name":"$500","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"minimum partial withdrawal amount","relational_anchors":["Article 6.2"]},{"name":"$25","type":"MONETARY_VALUE","role":"withdrawal charge during first decade","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"90%","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"maximum allowable loan percentage","relational_anchors":["Article 7.1"]},{"name":"Moody's Corporate Bond Index + 1.5%","type":"RATE","role":"variable loan interest calculation basis","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"4%","type":"MINIMUM_RATE","role":"floor rate for variable loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"January 1","type":"DATE","role":"annual adjustment date for loan interest","relational_anchors":["Article 7.2"]},{"name":"Years 1-10","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period when withdrawal charge applies","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"Years 11+","type":"YEAR_RANGE","role":"period with no withdrawal charge","relational_anchors":["Article 6.3"]},{"name":"8","type":"PERCENTAGE","role":"surrender charge in year one","relational_anchors":["Article 8.2"]},{"name":"