    <node id="3d0d0bde-d655-489a-890d-7b82ea492259">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Surrender &amp; Lapse Provisions","text":"═════════════════\n8.1 Cash Surrender Value = Account Value - Surrender Charge - \n    Outstanding Loans\n\n8.2 Surrender Charge Schedule (% of Specified Amount):\n    Year 1: 8% | Year 5: 5% | Year 10: 2% | Year 15+: 0%\n\n8.3 Upon surrender, the policy terminates and coverage ends.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 9 - LIMITATIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n9.1 SUICIDE EXCLUSION: If insured dies by suicide within 24 months \n    of issue date, we pay only the Account Value, without interest.\n\n9.2 CONTESTABILITY: We may contest this policy for material \n    misrepresentation within 2 years of issue date while insured \n    is living.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nARTICLE 10 - GRACE PERIOD AND LAPSE\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n10.1 If Account Value is insufficient to pay monthly deductions, \n     we will notify you. Policy continues for 61 days.\n\n10.2 If sufficient premium is not received within 61 days, policy \n     lapses.\n\n10.3 Upon lapse, any Account Value in excess of surrender charges \n     will be paid to you automatically.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nExecuted at Phoenix, Arizona\n\n[Signature]\nChief Executive Officer\nFlexProtect Insurance Solutions\n\nDate: March 10, 2024\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n","summary":"The cash surrender value equals the account value minus surrender charges and outstanding loans, with decreasing surrender fees over time. If surrendered, the policy terminates and coverage ends. Suicide within two years results in payment of only the account value; claims can be contested for misrepresentation during the first two years. A 61-day grace period follows if premiums aren't covered, after which the policy lapses—any remaining account value above surrender charges is returned automatically.","topics":["Cash Surrender Value","Policy Termination","Surrender Charges","Grace Period"],"facts":[{"name":"Cash Surrender Value Formula","sentence":"Cash Surrender Value equals Account Value minus Surrender Charge minus Outstanding Loans.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Cash Surrender Value","Account Value","Surrender Charge","Outstanding Loans"],"entities":[{"name":"Cash Surrender Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"financial metric upon termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Account Value","type":"CONCEPT","role":"net asset balance available post-surrender","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Surrender Charge","type":"CONCEPT","role":"penalty deducted during early withdrawal","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Outstanding Loans","type":"CONCEPT","role":"debt owed against account value","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Surrender Charge Schedule","type":"CONCEPT","role":"tiered percentage fee over time","relational_anchors":["Year 1: 8%","Year 5: 5%","Year 10: 2%","Year 15+: 0%"]},{"name":"March 10, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"execution date of contract","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Phoenix, Arizona","type":"LOCATION","role":"place of execution","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"FlexProtect Insurance Solutions","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer organization","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Chief Executive Officer","type":"PERSON","role":"executive signatory position","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Suicide Exclusion","type":"CONCEPT","role":"coverage limitation after death","relational_anchors":["within 24 months"]},{"name":"Contestability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"right to challenge validity","relational_anchors":["within 2 years"]},{"name":"Grace Period","type":"CONCEPT","role":"extension window before lapse","relational_anchors":["61 days"]},{"name":"Lapse","type":"CONCEPT","role":"termination due to non-payment","relational_anchors":[]}]},{