      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 establishes the regular date when monthly deductions occur, enabling predictable financial planning. Fact sentence 2 indicates that payments can be omitted if the account has sufficient value to withstand the deduction, implying reliance on the scheduled deduction timeline.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
