    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="b0f4f00a-0e54-49ad-bb1a-e78c2dfaa0d9">
      <data key="d3">The second sentence identifies a specific type of deduction—a $8.00 administrative fee—that takes place on the Monthly Deduction Date mentioned in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4">is part of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="d2d7f644-175d-4fe0-ae25-131e657d096a">
      <data key="d3">The Administrative expense charge of $8.00 is deducted monthly alongside other charges like the Cost of Insurance, contributing to the overall reduction of the account value without affecting the timing or nature of the first charge.</data>
      <data key="d4">simultaneously deducted</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e">
      <data key="d3">The administrative expense charge is consistently deducted monthly regardless of other factors. Loan interest is also deducted monthly but depends on the existence and balance of an outstanding policy loan.</data>
      <data key="d4">co occurs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="fcc5d4f1-98b6-4db9-90f4-acbeec66da4c">
      <data key="d3">The administrative expense charge reduces the account value available to support the death benefit calculation under Option B.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">The $8.00 monthly administrative charge mentioned in fact_sentence_2 contributes to the deductions subtracted from Account Value as outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="5d474352-9ca8-4438-912d-d598a9dfc72e">
      <data key="d3">The $8.00 monthly administrative charge operates independently of the variable COI, which fluctuates based on age, sex, and risk class.</data>
      <data key="d4">complementary charges</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="0a744329-f2e4-42aa-90c7-0552ff65e5c1">
      <data key="d3">While the $8.00 monthly administrative charge operates independently on the existing Account Value, it affects the pool that would otherwise grow from premiums after the 3% expense has been subtracted, creating cumulative impact on long-term accumulation.</data>
      <data key="d4">complementary charges</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="5e1c407b-5a34-46a9-a8c2-c1e5dc597284">
      <data key="d3">Monthly deductions like the $8.00 administrative charge can lead to insufficient Account Value, initiating the 61-day grace period before policy lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">triggers grace period</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="c7b13fca-a0cc-4be7-b051-d4ce5ea2b5ca">
      <data key="d3">The $8.00 monthly administrative fee reduces the account value, meaning part of the $200 planned premium may go toward covering such charges rather than building cash value.</data>
      <data key="d4">part of financial system</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="38c15270-6db4-451e-bef6-7610864a498c">
      <data key="d3">The $8.00 monthly administrative fee reduces the account value, making it essential that premiums—including the $75 minimum—cover these charges to prevent policy lapse or depletion of reserves.</data>
      <data key="d4">supported by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="c427846c-ffb1-42e7-abbe-84ee0c48f7e8">
      <data key="d3">Monthly administrative charges reduce the account value over time, indirectly affecting whether sufficient funds remain to support the full $400,000 death benefit, especially if premiums are insufficient.</data>
      <data key="d4">impacted by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="ca4ca85e-d0c7-4f15-93d4-03a1cb8f9b19">
      <data key="d3">The monthly administrative fee reduces the account value, which directly lowers the potential cash surrender value since it is derived from the account value before deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575">
      <data key="d3">The ongoing administrative fee applies only while the policy remains active; upon surrender, these deductions cease because the policy terminates.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24">
      <data key="d3">The monthly administrative fee continues accruing until the policy is surrendered, contributing to the reduction of the account value available at surrender. Upon surrender, coverage ends regardless of prior deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="9e69c3b1-81e7-420c-93e4-41aab51bc29d">
      <data key="d3">The administrative fee described in fact_sentence_1 triggers a monitoring process where insufficient funds lead to a notification, ensuring transparency before potential lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="70a90dda-a504-430c-b48f-97a62091716e">
      <data key="d3">The administrative fee described in fact_sentence_1 may trigger the 61-day grace period mentioned in fact_sentence_2 when unpaid due to low account balance.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a" target="31c00839-d964-44d5-8027-45be3fef034a">
      <data key="d3">The monthly administrative fee reduces the account value, thereby affecting the balance available for payout upon policy lapse, provided it exceeds surrender charges.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
