    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="b0f4f00a-0e54-49ad-bb1a-e78c2dfaa0d9">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest is deducted on the Monthly Deduction Date, making it a component of the broader set of monthly deductions taken from the account value.</data>
      <data key="d4">caused by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="d2d7f644-175d-4fe0-ae25-131e657d096a">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest is deducted monthly alongside other charges such as the Cost of Insurance, reflecting ongoing financing costs tied to borrowed amounts against the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">co occurs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest is charged only if there is an active policy loan and is subtracted alongside fixed administrative costs during monthly deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">co occurs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest is subtracted from the account value during monthly deductions, reflecting accrued debt costs. This process operates alongside daily interest credits that increase the account balance over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions occur monthly based on accumulated daily interest, which relies on the currently credited annual rate. Without knowledge of the daily interest rate, the exact amount of the deduction cannot be calculated.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="ceb49223-6965-4e32-9d3a-c537fbfff452">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions depend on the applicable interest rate, which determines the amount subtracted during each monthly deduction. The stated 3.5% annual rate governs the calculation of that interest.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="2e4a0b31-0a77-4786-b43e-9df3c67b4a3a">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions occur monthly based on the prevailing interest rate, which may fluctuate each month. This means the amount deducted could vary depending on the updated rate.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest is deducted on the Monthly Deduction Date based on the applicable interest rate, which is subject to a guaranteed minimum of 2%. This ensures that even if market rates fall below 2%, the policyholder’s account still earns at least that much.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="014c1341-ae5d-4598-84e5-2e2c6369bc50">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest is deducted monthly from the account value based on accumulated interest charges. This process may be influenced by differing annual credited interest rates applied during various policy years.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="53be9ad3-d3ad-4925-9bb5-c12ac65a8012">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions depend on the applicable interest rate, which varies according to account value tiers. This variation affects how much is deducted during each monthly cycle.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="fcc5d4f1-98b6-4db9-90f4-acbeec66da4c">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions reduce the Account Value, which directly impacts the computation of the Increasing Death Benefit under Option B, where the death benefit includes the Account Value.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="aa42baaa-8e4d-4623-89b2-4f42a9c006fa">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest accumulated over time increases the outstanding loan balance, which reduces the net death benefit payment. Therefore, the monthly deduction of interest contributes directly to the reduction applied during a claim settlement.</data>
      <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions occur monthly from the Account Value, aligning with the formula in fact_sentence_1 where Account Value is reduced by various charges, including those related to borrowed funds.</data>
      <data key="d4">part of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="5d474352-9ca8-4438-912d-d598a9dfc72e">
      <data key="d3">Policy loan interest is deducted monthly from the Account Value, similar in timing and mechanism to the Cost of Insurance (COI), though it stems from borrowed funds rather than mortality costs.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="0a744329-f2e4-42aa-90c7-0552ff65e5c1">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions from the Account Value can reduce the net growth potential of premiums already deposited, especially if balances are low, indirectly affecting long-term accumulation despite upfront allocation.</data>
      <data key="d4">affected by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="5e1c407b-5a34-46a9-a8c2-c1e5dc597284">
      <data key="d3">Monthly deduction of loan interest reduces Account Value, directly contributing to conditions that could trigger the 61-day grace period if balances become insufficient to meet ongoing charges.</data>
      <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="ca4ca85e-d0c7-4f15-93d4-03a1cb8f9b19">
      <data key="d3">Unpaid policy loan interest reduces the Account Value, thereby lowering the basis for calculating Cash Surrender Value, since the latter subtracts outstanding loans from the Account Value.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575">
      <data key="d3">Outstanding policy loan interest, deducted monthly from the account value, reduces the available funds at surrender, thereby impacting the final cash surrender value when the policy terminates.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24">
      <data key="d3">Outstanding policy loan interest reduces the account value monthly, affecting the final cash surrender value when coverage ends upon surrender.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="c17b6902-b6ee-401e-82aa-c2427e58266a">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest deductions affect the account value, which determines the payout if the insured dies by suicide within two years. Thus, accumulated interest could reduce the available account value subject to the suicide clause.</data>
      <data key="d4">indirectly affects</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="11c7e060-3470-463f-81cb-576f40036743">
      <data key="d3">Loan interest is regularly deducted from the account value monthly, but if the insured dies by suicide within 24 months, no interest is added to the resulting payment, effectively reducing the total payout despite normal deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">exception to rule</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="70a90dda-a504-430c-b48f-97a62091716e">
      <data key="d3">If loan interest reduces the Account Value below required levels, the policy continues for up to 61 days without lapse, providing temporary relief before termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="9e69c3b1-81e7-420c-93e4-41aab51bc29d">
      <data key="d3">When loan interest is deducted from the Account Value on the Monthly Deduction Date, insufficient funds trigger an insurer notification, ensuring policyholders are informed about potential financial shortfalls.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e" target="31c00839-d964-44d5-8027-45be3fef034a">
      <data key="d3">Outstanding policy loan interest reduces the Account Value incrementally each month, directly affecting the balance available for distribution upon policy lapse, thereby influencing whether any funds exceed surrender charges.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b956a029-4bb5-48d0-bbb5-7d4e77323524" target="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">trigger</data>
    </edge>
