    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest credit increases the account value incrementally, providing growth that may offset future loan interest charges subject to monthly deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7">
      <data key="d3">Interest is credited daily to the account value, relying on the prevailing credited interest rate to determine the exact amount added each day.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting relies on an underlying rate, which is bounded below by a guaranteed minimum of 2%. Without this guarantee, the actual daily credit could vary unpredictably.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="ceb49223-6965-4e32-9d3a-c537fbfff452">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest credit depends on the applicable annual rate, which is currently set at 3.5%. This rate directly influences the magnitude of each day’s accrual.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="2e4a0b31-0a77-4786-b43e-9df3c67b4a3a">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest credits depend on the current annual rate, which may adjust monthly, affecting the actual amount added each day.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="014c1341-ae5d-4598-84e5-2e2c6369bc50">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting applies consistently throughout the policy year, though the actual rate used may differ depending on the specific policy year.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="53be9ad3-d3ad-4925-9bb5-c12ac65a8012">
      <data key="d3">Daily crediting of interest provides the mechanism through which variable rates apply across differing account sizes. The frequency of credit supports the implementation of tiered interest rates based on account value levels.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="fcc5d4f1-98b6-4db9-90f4-acbeec66da4c">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest credit increases the account value, which directly enhances the death benefit under Option B since it adds to the account value component of the payout.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e" target="aa42baaa-8e4d-4623-89b2-4f42a9c006fa">
      <data key="d3">Daily crediting of interest increases the account value, which affects the total funds available for determining the net death benefit payment after deducting outstanding loans.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d9a54dc4-5098-4839-b4c6-5ec23fa972ab" target="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">determines the daily interest credited</data>
    </edge>
