    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="b0f4f00a-0e54-49ad-bb1a-e78c2dfaa0d9">
      <data key="d3">The daily interest crediting mechanism contributes to the account value that underlies the monthly deduction process.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e">
      <data key="d3">The daily interest rate determines the growth of the account value, which directly affects the amount of loan interest accrued and subsequently deducted during monthly deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">drives</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e">
      <data key="d3">The daily crediting of interest to the account value occurs based on the current credited interest rate, ensuring consistent application over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="ceb49223-6965-4e32-9d3a-c537fbfff452">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting relies on the currently applied interest rate, which is specified here as 3.5% per annum.</data>
      <data key="d4">derives from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting depends on the current rate, but it cannot fall below the guaranteed minimum of 2.0%, which ensures stability even if market rates decline.</data>
      <data key="d4">constrains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="2e4a0b31-0a77-4786-b43e-9df3c67b4a3a">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting uses the currently applied rate, which may vary each month due to adjustments in the annual rate.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="014c1341-ae5d-4598-84e5-2e2c6369bc50">
      <data key="d3">The daily interest calculation relies on the currently active credited interest rate, which may differ depending on the policy year. This temporal variation ensures that the rate used for daily crediting is consistent with the relevant period.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="53be9ad3-d3ad-4925-9bb5-c12ac65a8012">
      <data key="d3">The daily interest calculation relies on the credited interest rate, which varies based on the account value. Thus, the rate used in the computation differs according to how large the account balance is.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="fcc5d4f1-98b6-4db9-90f4-acbeec66da4c">
      <data key="d3">The daily interest crediting mechanism increases the account value, which directly contributes to the total death benefit under Option B, where the payout includes both the specified amount and the growing account value.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting, driven by the stated rate, directly impacts the growth of Account Value as defined in the initial statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="5d474352-9ca8-4438-912d-d598a9dfc72e">
      <data key="d3">Interest crediting depends on the account value after COI and other fees have been applied, meaning COI directly shapes the principal used to calculate daily interest gains.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="0a744329-f2e4-42aa-90c7-0552ff65e5c1">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest accumulation depends on the Account Value, which itself is determined by premiums adjusted for the 3% expense charge, making the timing and amount of premium deposits critical to interest earnings.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="5e1c407b-5a34-46a9-a8c2-c1e5dc597284">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest credits contribute to rebuilding the account value, helping prevent it from dropping into the range that triggers the 61-day grace period.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="ca4ca85e-d0c7-4f15-93d4-03a1cb8f9b19">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting increases the account value, which is a key component used in calculating the Cash Surrender Value. Thus, the interest rate impacts the final surrender value.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="d2bec389-f814-4532-8f19-68d9fc0c9d10">
      <data key="d3">Interest crediting affects the growth of the account value, which influences the basis for calculating surrender charges in Year 1. Higher accrued interest increases the account value, thereby raising the potential dollar amount subject to the 8% surrender charge.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting ceases upon policy surrender, making ongoing interest irrelevant once the contract terminates.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting ceases upon surrender, meaning any accrued but uncredited interest up to the surrender date may not fully reflect final gains due to termination of coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="be5a6946-58ba-4487-a91b-97d9949ba78f">
      <data key="d3">Interest accrual increases the account value over time, which influences the total cash surrender value available before deducting surrender charges. The 5% surrender charge in Year 5 reduces the final payout, partially offsetting gains from credited interest.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa">
      <data key="d3">Interest accrual affects the account value used to calculate surrender benefits; since surrender charges vanish in Year 15+, the fully accrued interest becomes accessible tax-free under certain conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="11c7e060-3470-463f-81cb-576f40036743">
      <data key="d3">Interest crediting normally applies daily based on the current rate, but if the insured dies by suicide within 24 months, no additional interest is added to the account value payout.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="c17b6902-b6ee-401e-82aa-c2427e58266a">
      <data key="d3">The daily interest crediting mechanism affects the growth of the account value, which in turn determines the payout amount if the insured dies by suicide within 24 months.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="9e69c3b1-81e7-420c-93e4-41aab51bc29d">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting helps maintain or grow the account value, reducing the risk of it falling below the threshold needed to cover monthly deductions, thereby influencing whether a notification is triggered.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="31c00839-d964-44d5-8027-45be3fef034a">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting increases the account value over time, directly affecting the amount available for return upon policy lapse, provided it exceeds surrender charges.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="d24747c1-d663-4439-9454-0b5bd8f1185c">
      <data key="d3">Interest crediting depends on active policy status; if the policy lapses due to missed premiums, further interest credit ceases. Thus, timely premium payment ensures continued interest accrual.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7" target="70a90dda-a504-430c-b48f-97a62091716e">
      <data key="d3">Daily interest crediting increases the account value, helping prevent it from falling below the threshold needed to cover monthly deductions, thereby delaying or avoiding activation of the 61-day grace period.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f2fc8153-47a2-4253-9c20-d377b23307b4" target="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">determines</data>
    </edge>
