      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">charge</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="cce135a7-36e1-470a-8209-f0b649945f35">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">formula</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="7a4fbe51-899c-4e62-8904-43b53528d9e0">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">rate</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="c1ee6ef5-a773-4336-be7f-9c65d05239e6">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">interest rate</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="7c125725-0224-44aa-8b18-b1b5db2f43eb">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">interest rate</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="cfdb67b0-b0de-470c-99b8-9004b4f9102d">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">option</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="c5bfa9a1-2973-4813-8115-f998f3d22c77">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">option</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="f1fbe5aa-c112-4d53-8a76-f2f37dee7836">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">condition</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="23b8d059-227b-4f89-b6e3-5156e2839f3f">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">charge</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="5f46ff64-015d-450b-b4e0-b1fd61f70b9c">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">benefit</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="b0f4f00a-0e54-49ad-bb1a-e78c2dfaa0d9">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate of 2.0% sets a foundational condition under which monthly deductions are calculated, ensuring predictable growth even if market rates fall below this threshold.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum annual interest rate of 2.0% sets a baseline for how little interest may be credited to the account, affecting the overall growth and thus indirectly impacting the magnitude of future loan interest charges and deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="267656a2-1874-42ab-acb1-f06594a6ea4e">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures stability in the daily crediting process, preventing it from falling below 2% annually regardless of external conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">enforces</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate of 2.0% constrains the range within which the daily interest crediting rate may operate, preventing it from dropping further.</data>
      <data key="d4">bound by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="ceb49223-6965-4e32-9d3a-c537fbfff452">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum annual interest rate ensures that even if market conditions worsen, the account will still earn at least 2%. This sets a baseline against which the current 3.5% rate is measured.</data>
      <data key="d4">sets boundary</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="2e4a0b31-0a77-4786-b43e-9df3c67b4a3a">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures that even if the current rate fluctuates downward, it will not drop below 2%. This sets a baseline protection against negative rates.</data>
      <data key="d4">constrains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="014c1341-ae5d-4598-84e5-2e2c6369bc50">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures stability even if actual rates vary over time. Different policy years may experience differing credited rates based on performance or other factors.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="53be9ad3-d3ad-4925-9bb5-c12ac65a8012">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures a baseline return of 2%, while actual credited rates may vary depending on the account’s value, allowing for potential increases above this floor under certain conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="fcc5d4f1-98b6-4db9-90f4-acbeec66da4c">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures stable growth of the account value, which contributes to the total death benefit under Option B. This foundational rate indirectly supports the increasing nature of the death benefit by maintaining consistent accumulation.</data>
      <data key="d4">indirectly supports</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate of 2.0% sets a floor for the interest applied to the Account Value, ensuring predictable growth despite fluctuating market conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">sets floor for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="5d474352-9ca8-4438-912d-d598a9dfc72e">
      <data key="d3">A guaranteed minimum interest rate of 2.0% supports account value accumulation, helping offset ongoing costs such as the cost of insurance, which varies by individual risk profile.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="0a744329-f2e4-42aa-90c7-0552ff65e5c1">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum annual interest rate of 2.0% applies to the Account Value, which includes funds left after deducting the 3% premium expense charge described in fact_sentence_1, ensuring baseline returns regardless of market conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="5e1c407b-5a34-46a9-a8c2-c1e5dc597284">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a 61-day grace period provides temporary relief when account value declines due to insufficient returns, but the guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures some stability in accumulation even under poor performance, reducing the likelihood of such decline.</data>
      <data key="d4">indirectly supports</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="ca4ca85e-d0c7-4f15-93d4-03a1cb8f9b19">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures that the account value grows steadily, which increases the potential cash surrender value by boosting the base figure before deductions for surrender charges and loans.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures steady growth of the account value over time, indirectly supporting higher cash surrender values in later years like Year 15, where surrender charges vanish. This supports the viability of accessing accumulated funds without penalties.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures stable growth of the account value, which contributes to the cash surrender value upon policy termination. This makes the financial impact of surrender more predictable based on accumulated interest.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="11c7e060-3470-463f-81cb-576f40036743">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate applies broadly unless overridden by a suicide clause, which explicitly prevents interest accumulation on the account value in cases of early suicide deaths.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional override</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="c17b6902-b6ee-401e-82aa-c2427e58266a">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate influences the accumulation of the account value, which directly determines the payout in case of suicide within the contestable period. Higher interest accrual increases the account value, thereby raising the potential payout under the suicide clause.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures stable growth of the account value, which directly impacts the cash surrender value upon policy termination. However, the fact that surrender terminates the policy stands independently of the interest rate guarantee.</data>
      <data key="d4">indirectly affects</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="9e69c3b1-81e7-420c-93e4-41aab51bc29d">
      <data key="d3">A guaranteed minimum interest rate of 2.0% helps maintain the account value, reducing the risk that it becomes too low to cover monthly deductions, thereby mitigating the likelihood of triggering a notification under fact_sentence_2.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="d24747c1-d663-4439-9454-0b5bd8f1185c">
      <data key="d3">A guaranteed minimum interest rate supports sustained account value growth, helping ensure funds remain available to meet premium obligations during the 61-day grace period before policy lapse.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="70a90dda-a504-430c-b48f-97a62091716e">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures stable account value growth, helping maintain sufficient funds to avoid immediate lapse despite monthly deductions, thereby supporting the functionality of the 61-day grace period.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079" target="31c00839-d964-44d5-8027-45be3fef034a">
      <data key="d3">The guaranteed minimum interest rate ensures steady growth of the account value, which increases the potential amount returned to the policyholder upon lapse beyond surrender charges.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
