      <data key="d3">The selection of the Level Death Benefit (Option A) sets the stage for possible future changes. Any transition away from this option would incur a $50 processing fee, making the fee contingent on such an action.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="82af251d-d19c-45d0-95c3-15db9a931c70" target="fed25863-324a-4e70-9aea-8082dbd86103">
      <data key="d3">The current selection of Level Death Benefit implies that any move toward increased coverage would trigger the need for evidence of insurability, making this requirement contextually relevant to potential upgrades.</data>
