    <edge source="24c5ad15-0f69-45ce-be24-f83388bd917d" target="0ca94573-8672-4372-9074-da09fea51f72">
      <data key="d3">The absence of withdrawal charges from year 11 onward enhances the practicality of making partial withdrawals at any time, especially for policyholders planning longer-term liquidity needs.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances accessibility</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="24c5ad15-0f69-45ce-be24-f83388bd917d" target="c7dd6118-69b1-47ff-a5b4-fc2086782f63">
      <data key="d3">Withdrawals made after year 10 avoid fees, making them more favorable; however, even then, they still must satisfy the $500 minimum requirement.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="24c5ad15-0f69-45ce-be24-f83388bd917d" target="78ae0a1e-3056-4039-bbc1-344b5b6b24a5">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 states that no withdrawal charge applies from year 11 onward, reducing the cost barrier for accessing funds. This temporal exemption complements the structural constraint described in fact_sentence_1, which governs how much can be withdrawn regardless of timing.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="24c5ad15-0f69-45ce-be24-f83388bd917d" target="41c5d4e5-1a4c-49c6-93b9-86a0c912c977">
      <data key="d3">The absence of a withdrawal fee in year 11 onward implies that prior rules—such as the $25 fee in early years—are time-limited and do not extend past decade one.</data>
      <data key="d4">time limited</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="24c5ad15-0f69-45ce-be24-f83388bd917d" target="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08">
      <data key="d3">Withdrawals made in year 11 or later are exempt from charges, yet each such action reduces the account value as per standard policy rules.</data>
      <data key="d4">exempt from fee</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="81fbebff-2c3f-4e33-8c68-7e12aaeaf156" target="24c5ad15-0f69-45ce-be24-f83388bd917d">
