      <data key="d3">Reducing the Account Value through a partial withdrawal necessitates adherence to the $500 minimum threshold to maintain policy integrity and compliance.</data>
      <data key="d4">required by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="78ae0a1e-3056-4039-bbc1-344b5b6b24a5">
      <data key="d3">Since partial withdrawals diminish the account value, they inherently constrain how much can be withdrawn without jeopardizing the policy’s continued existence.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="41c5d4e5-1a4c-49c6-93b9-86a0c912c977">
      <data key="d3">The act of withdrawing money triggers a $25 fee if done within the first ten years, reflecting administrative costs associated with access to policy funds.</data>
      <data key="d4">incurred by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="24c5ad15-0f69-45ce-be24-f83388bd917d">
      <data key="d3">Reducing the account value through partial withdrawals has implications for future policy costs and benefits, including eligibility for fee-free withdrawals beyond year 10.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces value</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="14cbd8d0-a65c-4695-bdf2-4321ad3892d2">
      <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals lower the Account Value, which could lead to falling below the minimum threshold necessary to maintain full death benefit levels.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="6af7d75d-09de-48d0-a36c-4995b7e25cb6">
      <data key="d3">Reduced Account Value from partial withdrawals lowers the cap on how much can be borrowed via policy loans, since the maximum loan is pegged to the current Account Value.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="e467f66f-8ebe-41fd-8e9c-a879c062996c">
      <data key="d3">Partial withdrawals decrease the Account Value, which directly impacts the calculation of Cash Surrender Value since it is derived from the reduced Account Value.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">The reduction caused by partial withdrawals affects the calculation of Account Value, which depends on net contributions and ongoing adjustments.</data>
      <data key="d4">affected by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="0a744329-f2e4-42aa-90c7-0552ff65e5c1">
      <data key="d3">The Account Value, built from net premiums after expenses, serves as the foundation for allowable partial withdrawals, which diminish it accordingly.</data>
      <data key="d4">affects value</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="5e1c407b-5a34-46a9-a8c2-c1e5dc597284">
      <data key="d3">Reduced Account Value from partial withdrawals can lead to the policy entering a 61-day grace period if balances drop too low to sustain monthly charges.</data>
      <data key="d4">increases risk of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.87</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08" target="d59f0cd9-1a58-404b-85a4-9cde309d52b8">
      <data key="d3">While partial withdrawals decrease account value independently, the resulting lower value affects the calculation of surrender charges, making them more impactful if surrender occurs later.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="96754635-264d-4ae6-9522-54afefde2111" target="50663f78-143a-4016-b611-650692d96c08">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">reduces account value via withdrawal</data>
    </edge>
