      <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 provides foundational definitions such as account value calculation, flexible premiums, and beneficiary allocation, which are necessary to understand the later provisions about surrender, grace periods, and claim eligibility.</data>
      <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
