    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="ca4ca85e-d0c7-4f15-93d4-03a1cb8f9b19">
      <data key="d3">When surrender charges drop to 0% in year 15 or beyond, they do not reduce the account value when computing the cash surrender value, simplifying its determination.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="d2bec389-f814-4532-8f19-68d9fc0c9d10">
      <data key="d3">A 0% surrender charge in Year 15 or later implies that earlier years had higher charges, such as the 8% rate in Year 1, showing a progressive decline.</data>
      <data key="d4">increased from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="be5a6946-58ba-4487-a91b-97d9949ba78f">
      <data key="d3">By year 15, surrender charges have decreased to zero, demonstrating the culmination of a gradual decline initiated earlier, such as in year 5 when the charge was still 5%.</data>
      <data key="d4">increased from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="ddfa898f-d3e4-4e89-9fe3-ece66a9197ed">
      <data key="d3">A 0% surrender charge in year 15 or later implies that earlier years, such as year 10, had higher charges like 2%.</data>
      <data key="d4">increased from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575">
      <data key="d3">When surrender charges are waived from year 15 onward, the policyholder may surrender the policy without financial penalties, leading directly to its termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24">
      <data key="d3">If surrender occurs in year 15 or later, there are no surrender charges, allowing the policyholder to terminate the policy freely. Upon such surrender, the coverage permanently ends.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="31c00839-d964-44d5-8027-45be3fef034a">
      <data key="d3">When surrender charges drop to 0% in year 15 or later, the policyholder retains the full account value upon lapse, allowing it to be paid out automatically without deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="e467f66f-8ebe-41fd-8e9c-a879c062996c">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 includes surrender charges as a deduction in calculating cash surrender value, so knowing that these charges become zero after Year 15 (as stated in fact_sentence_2) significantly alters the outcome of that equation.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="733fa6c6-1173-4248-94bb-47741de40661">
      <data key="d3">The absence of surrender charges from year 15 onward complements the early-year 8% charge, showing a phased decline designed to incentivize long-term retention of the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">reduced from initial</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="ce5368c1-45d3-4d18-a2cd-ed25bfce9ea9">
      <data key="d3">When surrender charges end in year 15+, any outstanding policy loans still reduce the death benefit, making it crucial to manage debt levels before terminating the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7">
      <data key="d3">Zero surrender charge in Year 15+ enables complete retention of the account value grown through daily interest credits, making future interest gains fully recoverable upon termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079">
      <data key="d3">The absence of surrender charges from Year 15 onward allows policyholders to fully realize the benefits of compounded interest, especially under the guaranteed minimum rate of 2.0%, enabling complete access to the account value without deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="ceb49223-6965-4e32-9d3a-c537fbfff452">
      <data key="d3">When surrender charges reach 0% in Year 15 or later, the full account value—including gains from the 3.5% annual interest—is accessible, making the interest rate relevant to the final surrender benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances value</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">When surrender charges reach 0% in Year 15+, the entire Account Value becomes available, making the initial definition of Account Value critical to determining the actual return at surrender.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances value</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="d59f0cd9-1a58-404b-85a4-9cde309d52b8">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 specifies that surrender charges drop to zero after year 15, directly explaining the endpoint condition implied by fact_sentence_1’s limitation to the first 15 years.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa" target="0a744329-f2e4-42aa-90c7-0552ff65e5c1">
      <data key="d3">Surrender charges vanish after year 15, meaning any previously paid premiums—including those reduced by the 3% fee—are fully accessible. This enhances the effective growth potential of the Account Value established via early premium allocations.</data>
      <data key="d4">enhances value</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
