      <data key="d4">concept</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="f31d686e-5446-48c9-9f2f-fe4913c48a8a">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">concept</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="ca4ca85e-d0c7-4f15-93d4-03a1cb8f9b19">
      <data key="d3">The termination of the policy upon surrender implies that the financial settlement based on the cash surrender value becomes relevant, making the initial definition necessary for clarity.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="d2bec389-f814-4532-8f19-68d9fc0c9d10">
      <data key="d3">Policy termination upon surrender depends on the presence of surrender charges, such as the 8% fee in year one, which determines how much of the account value is retained or forfeited.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="be5a6946-58ba-4487-a91b-97d9949ba78f">
      <data key="d3">Policy termination occurs upon surrender, which triggers the application of the 5% surrender charge in year 5 based on the specified amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="ddfa898f-d3e4-4e89-9fe3-ece66a9197ed">
      <data key="d3">Termination of the policy upon surrender necessitates applying any applicable surrender charges, such as the 2% fee in year 10.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa">
      <data key="d3">The act of terminating the policy through surrender implies that any associated surrender charges have already been satisfied or eliminated, such as those being zero in year 15 or later.</data>
      <data key="d4">required by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, it terminates, resulting in the cessation of insurance coverage. This reflects the direct outcome of policy termination on benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="11c7e060-3470-463f-81cb-576f40036743">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, it terminates, which sets the stage for how death benefits are handled under special circumstances like suicide within two years. In such cases, the payout is limited to the account value without additional interest.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="adf31acf-2732-44ca-9d60-9d2ebd3c0e20">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, it terminates, which triggers potential scrutiny by the insurer regarding any misrepresentations made at issuance, especially within the initial two-year window.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="d24747c1-d663-4439-9454-0b5bd8f1185c">
      <data key="d3">When a policyholder surrenders the policy, it terminates immediately. This contrasts with lapse due to non-payment, where a 61-day grace period precedes termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="e467f66f-8ebe-41fd-8e9c-a879c062996c">
      <data key="d3">Policy termination upon surrender enables the application of the Cash Surrender Value formula, where account value is adjusted for charges and loans.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="733fa6c6-1173-4248-94bb-47741de40661">
      <data key="d3">Policy termination upon surrender implies that any surrender charge, such as the 8% fee in year one, becomes applicable, reinforcing the financial impact of ending the contract.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="ce5368c1-45d3-4d18-a2cd-ed25bfce9ea9">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, any outstanding loans—which reduce the death benefit—are deducted from the account value, concluding the financial obligations tied to those loans.</data>
      <data key="d4">impacted by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="d2d7f644-175d-4fe0-ae25-131e657d096a">
      <data key="d3">Policy termination through surrender stops further application of the monthly Cost of Insurance charge, making the timing of surrender relevant to accumulated deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a">
      <data key="d3">Policy surrender ends the life of the contract, thereby stopping future administrative deductions like the $8.00 monthly charge.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates if</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered and terminated, any accumulated but unpaid loan interest continues to accrue up to that point, affecting the total reduction in account value before the surrender proceeds are calculated.</data>
      <data key="d4">affected by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="2e4a0b31-0a77-4786-b43e-9df3c67b4a3a">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, its termination locks in the accumulated account value affected by prior interest rates, meaning the variability of the interest rate directly shapes the surrender outcome.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7">
      <data key="d3">Policy termination through surrender stops further accumulation of daily interest, rendering the interest rate mechanism inactive post-surrender.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079">
      <data key="d3">While the policy terminating upon surrender depends on contractual terms like surrender charges and account value, the guaranteed 2.0% interest rate indirectly supports the accumulation of funds used in calculating the surrender value, thus influencing the outcome of termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="ceb49223-6965-4e32-9d3a-c537fbfff452">
      <data key="d3">Termination of the policy upon surrender reduces future accrual of interest, meaning the ongoing 3.5% rate no longer applies once the policy ends.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="53be9ad3-d3ad-4925-9bb5-c12ac65a8012">
      <data key="d3">Policy surrender ending coverage impacts the realization of accrued interest tied to account value, though it doesn’t alter the stated interest rate rules.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575" target="aa42baaa-8e4d-4623-89b2-4f42a9c006fa">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, it ends and no death benefit is paid; however, like death benefit disbursements, the surrender value adjusts for existing loans, linking the treatment of debt across these distinct triggers.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
