      <data key="d3">Terminating the policy via surrender activates the surrender charge mechanism outlined in fact_sentence_1, meaning the penalty is enforced precisely because the policy ends at that point.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
