    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="ca4ca85e-d0c7-4f15-93d4-03a1cb8f9b19">
      <data key="d3">Surrendering the policy results in its termination and loss of coverage, which depends on having a defined cash surrender value derived from the account value less deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="d2bec389-f814-4532-8f19-68d9fc0c9d10">
      <data key="d3">Termination of coverage occurs when the policy is surrendered, which happens under conditions including paying a surrender charge equal to 8% of the specified amount in year one.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="be5a6946-58ba-4487-a91b-97d9949ba78f">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, coverage ends, which triggers the application of the 5% surrender charge in year 5 on the specified amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="ddfa898f-d3e4-4e89-9fe3-ece66a9197ed">
      <data key="d3">When coverage ends due to surrender, it triggers the application of the surrender charge, such as the 2% fee specified in year 10.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="f6b5e972-2fde-453a-98fa-9ea8711ed5fa">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, its coverage terminates. This outcome becomes fully accessible in year 15 or later when surrender charges drop to zero.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="0155c9de-0b82-477a-9ec7-27cf965dc575">
      <data key="d3">Coverage ends upon surrender because the policy has terminated, meaning the contractual obligations cease entirely.</data>
      <data key="d4">follows from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="11c7e060-3470-463f-81cb-576f40036743">
      <data key="d3">Surrendering the policy ends coverage permanently, which may trigger special provisions like limited payouts in cases of suicide within two years. This context helps explain why suicide-related clauses apply when policies terminate early.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="64f378fd-3e2e-4610-87e4-f7c8a0139286">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, coverage ends immediately, but the insurer retains the right to challenge claims based on misrepresentation made during the first two years, even post-surrender.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="d24747c1-d663-4439-9454-0b5bd8f1185c">
      <data key="d3">Surrendering the policy ends coverage immediately, whereas nonpayment beyond the 61-day grace period leads to an automatic lapse. These represent distinct pathways by which coverage may terminate.</data>
      <data key="d4">alternative cause</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="70a90dda-a504-430c-b48f-97a62091716e">
      <data key="d3">If the policyholder surrenders the policy, coverage ends immediately. However, if the account value cannot cover monthly deductions, the policy remains active for up to 61 days, preventing automatic termination until the end of the grace period.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="e467f66f-8ebe-41fd-8e9c-a879c062996c">
      <data key="d3">When coverage ends upon surrender, the resulting cash payout is determined by subtracting surrender charges and loans from the account value, consistent with fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="733fa6c6-1173-4248-94bb-47741de40661">
      <data key="d3">Coverage ending upon surrender (fact_sentence_2) explains why a surrender charge exists in year one (fact_sentence_1)—the penalty is triggered specifically when the policy is terminated.</data>
      <data key="d4">justifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="ce5368c1-45d3-4d18-a2cd-ed25bfce9ea9">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, coverage ends, making any outstanding loans irrelevant to future death benefit payments since no claim would occur post-surrender.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="d2d7f644-175d-4fe0-ae25-131e657d096a">
      <data key="d3">Termination via surrender ends the obligation to pay the monthly cost of insurance, effectively nullifying future deductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates dependency</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="b3a92b86-1b3f-437a-94f2-971cc4413b8a">
      <data key="d3">When the policy is surrendered, the accumulated administrative fees have already reduced the account value, affecting the final cash surrender value. Coverage termination occurs independently of these fees but impacts the timing of such reductions.</data>
      <data key="d4">affected by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="40116a52-d516-4b17-8b5c-41312619c88e">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, the accumulated loan interest previously deducted from the account value determines the net return, influencing whether there’s a positive or negative settlement.</data>
      <data key="d4">impacted by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="2e4a0b31-0a77-4786-b43e-9df3c67b4a3a">
      <data key="d3">Coverage ending upon surrender means the ongoing accrual of interest based on the current rate ceases entirely, making future compounding irrelevant once the policy is terminated.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates accrual</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="de1c9695-ef86-44d3-817c-e20ff49543a7">
      <data key="d3">Surrendering the policy halts future interest accumulation, making ongoing interest crediting irrelevant post-surrender despite prior rates being applied daily.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="5055565e-cbfe-44d3-be16-afa1d965e079">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, coverage ends, terminating future interest accruals. Thus, the guaranteed minimum interest rate no longer applies post-surrender, limiting its influence on final returns.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="ceb49223-6965-4e32-9d3a-c537fbfff452">
      <data key="d3">Coverage ending upon surrender means the ongoing accrual of interest at 3.5% ceases, affecting future account value accumulation.</data>
      <data key="d4">affected by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">When a policy is surrendered, the end of coverage relies on the current Account Value, which was previously defined by accumulated premiums, fees, and interest.</data>
      <data key="d4">informs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="d59f0cd9-1a58-404b-85a4-9cde309d52b8">
      <data key="d3">Ending coverage upon surrender directly justifies the imposition of a percentage-based surrender charge, as outlined in fact_sentence_1, since the insurer loses future risk exposure.</data>
      <data key="d4">justifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="0a744329-f2e4-42aa-90c7-0552ff65e5c1">
      <data key="d3">Ending coverage upon surrender implies that any previously accrued Account Value from premium allocations becomes subject to withdrawal conditions, though it does not affect the initial allocation process itself.</data>
      <data key="d4">result of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24" target="5e1c407b-5a34-46a9-a8c2-c1e5dc597284">
      <data key="d3">Surrendering the policy ends coverage immediately, bypassing any potential grace period or lapse process triggered by declining account value.</data>
      <data key="d4">preempts grace period</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
