    </edge>
    <edge source="64f378fd-3e2e-4610-87e4-f7c8a0139286" target="afcce2ca-db53-4aa4-8a56-3863abb45a24">
      <data key="d3">During the two-year contestability period, insurers can dispute claims related to misrepresentation, which may affect payouts if the policyholder surrenders or dies before expiration.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="64f378fd-3e2e-4610-87e4-f7c8a0139286" target="c17b6902-b6ee-401e-82aa-c2427e58266a">
      <data key="d3">During the two-year contestability period, the insurer may investigate and reject claims due to misrepresentation, which justifies paying only the account value if death by suicide occurs within that timeframe.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="64f378fd-3e2e-4610-87e4-f7c8a0139286" target="11c7e060-3470-463f-81cb-576f40036743">
      <data key="d3">During the two-year contestability period, the insurer can dispute claims such as suicide-related payouts, leading to reduced benefits including exclusion of accrued interest on the account value.</data>
      <data key="d4">justifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="64f378fd-3e2e-4610-87e4-f7c8a0139286" target="adf31acf-2732-44ca-9d60-9d2ebd3c0e20">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 establishes the two-year window during which the insurer can challenge the policy, providing contextual validity to fact_sentence_1’s claim about contesting based on misrepresentation within that timeframe.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="64f378fd-3e2e-4610-87e4-f7c8a0139286" target="e467f66f-8ebe-41fd-8e9c-a879c062996c">
      <data key="d3">The existence of a contestability period means an insurer might deny a surrender payout even if the cash surrender value is calculable under fact_sentence_1, introducing uncertainty about actual disbursement regardless of the defined formula.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences calculation</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="64f378fd-3e2e-4610-87e4-f7c8a0139286" target="b74a2cf6-0be5-410f-8b0b-75a035485c22">
      <data key="d3">The two-year contestability period affects claim validity, potentially limiting payout amounts even if an individual’s Account Value has accumulated according to the formula defined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">affects value</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
